  "prefLabel": "Plu 404.04 Reinstatement Application Form",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 404.04 Reinstatement Application Form. The reinstatement application form shall require the applicant to furnish the information which an applicant for initial licensure is required to provide on the initial licensure application form described in Plu 302.03 except for answers to the questions described in Plu 302.03(d)(7), Plu 302.03(d)(8) and Plu 302.03(d)(10).\n\nSource. #9044, eff 12-5-07; ss by #9608, eff 12-2-07",
